    "body": "Thanks for the feedback. I'll work on adding a new \"Fatal\" column as domenic suggested and rewording the descriptions to try not to repeat the \"This error occurs when...\". \r\n\r\nI agree that an additional column probably isn't the best approach for the example input. The HTML [parse errors](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#parse-errors) table appears to put notes and examples right under the error description text, so I'll experiment with doing that and hopefully things don't get too cluttered.",
